<Defs>
  <!-- Wuxia weapons (docs/modulos/CONTENIDO_TOI_ACS.md): mortal versions of the classic Chinese arms, built like the vanilla
       medieval/neolithic weapons (same bases, recipes at the smithy; the spirit forge copies them). Spirit grade 0: the
       material raises it (DefModExtension_SpiritGradeMaterial on spirit steel, moon silver, jade bamboo, peach timber...).
       The CVG_SpiritSword/Sabre/Spear/Bow in Weapons.xml are the spirit-grade ones. -->
  <ThingDef ParentName="BaseMeleeWeapon_Sharp_Quality">
    <defName>CVG_Jian</defName>
    <label>jian</label>
    <description>The straight double-edged sword, called the gentleman of weapons. Every sword sect of Jiuxiao began with a mortal jian and a disciple who practised the same nine cuts for ten years; the Azure Peak still hands one to each new disciple before any spirit blade. Forged from spirit steel or moon silver it already bites into the qi of cultivators.</description>
